name quotmark
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Consistent quote marks
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a means of ensuring consistent quote marks
longdesc throughout your document. The style can be changed either via
longdesc package option or command, and the package detects language
longdesc selections (from the babel or ngerman packages), and uses the
longdesc punctuation marks appropriate for the current language. The
longdesc author now considers the package obsolete, and recommends use
longdesc of csquotes in its place.
